ollowing diagrams shows the vector $-\\frac{3}{2}a$?" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ must be parallel to $a$.\n\nNow, for the vector $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ is $\\frac{3}{2}$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ have opposite directions since the factor $-\\frac{3}{2}$ is negative.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](images/c5/c5ae3d645aaa0a5cae7a8c5ee0b346310591eaf2bc884475c930ceff3f5bdb68.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503931 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2628b656-dd22-53e7-a2d9-e4343567af08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9f/9f0b0931aadbc18528b5ac6bbf6e6d5539d40138d67819729e3c6d716964d922.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503938} {:answer/id #uuid "3785f1ec-04a0-500b-88cf-d2bb7367efa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/52/52ecefb3db162b4e67c6ae7e3f4c546c1a779788e3b00e3302d3ae468b88123f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503946} {:answer/id #uuid "5ec70842-71a0-539d-925a-d0a0adbdb306" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7f/7f63c606fff90d3d867a8b24a50855cc66c0fbb9e97748f429f5a53641f29c67.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503954} {:answer/id #uuid "82b33c46-f9f5-5628-a109-cef62b189443" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b3/b37adc4bbc907e8c44bb4c06a7e636d172f0d2b65edbba485fbcf2e7f01e752b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503970} {:answer/id #uuid "88f70ae6-2e36-5a42-bd32-624433e9fea3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d61b72dadcf293995666b387f723cc8c68c7690bd9c18e55db20fca4d21dcdf7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503972}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ec70842-71a0-539d-925a-d0a0adbdb306" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7f/7f63c606fff90d3d867a8b24a50855cc66c0fbb9e97748f429f5a53641f29c67.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503954} :