bf{a}$\n3. $\\mathbf{a}=2\\mathbf{e}$\n\n![](images/95/95ae711c1ccbf7543e6d269aa8d817a66e2ac348113ea71f3a1babcbb23d1ca3.png)" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $\\mathbf{b}$ and $\\mathbf{c}$ have different magnitudes. So, $\\mathbf{b} \\neq -\\mathbf{c}$.\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{e}$ are parallel and have the same direction. Also, the magnitude of $\\mathbf{e}$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $\\mathbf{a}$. So, $\\mathbf{e}=2\\mathbf{a}$.\n- Statement III is false. The magnitude of $\\mathbf{e}$ is greater than the magnitude of $\\mathbf{a}$. So, $\\mathbf{a} \\neq 2\\mathbf{e}$.\n\nTherefore, only statement II is true."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "dc5bab6c-1ce7-58b5-a59d-cff2ce35ecca" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186097158 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0d11031-4859-5c18-a3c1-a29fdf69be69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439571} {:answer/id #uuid "2f6b3797-bc0a-57ee-b5e9-05a8d253244c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439572}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f6b3797-bc0a-57ee-b5e9-05a8d253244c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439572} :answer-field/id #uuid "0962debc-57b0-568e-90b0-5410abe6457f" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440143} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f6ab4fed-b119-57df-944d-21162db1d99e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439573} {:answer/id #uuid "2adb021c-3f9a-5df3-8f83-f7723c7eeaea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439574}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2adb021c-3f9a-5df3-8f83-f7723c7eeaea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/valu