c66" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504969}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1bac862a-89e7-5ff0-8707-8ba70047c178" :question/problem "![](images/ae/ae3cb3c0a30251ff66193040df7d2f564e771ba60ec711c915099ee2056bfcb5.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $b =-2e$\n- **II.** $c =-d$\n- **III.** $b = 2e$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $b$ and $e$ have the same direction. So, $b\\neq-2e$.\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $c$ and $d$ have the same direction. So, $c\\neq-d$.\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, vectors $e$ and $b$ are parallel and have the same direction. Also, the magnitude of $b$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $b=2e$.\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504870 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5fe262c0-3823-594c-abf0-453c227fe104" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504900} {:answer/id #uuid "b8b3b690-7fc9-5042-90d5-d701897fbf9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504957}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b8b3b690-7fc9-5042-90d5-d701897fbf9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504957} :answer-field/id #uuid "2fa6634f-8f71-591a-97ed-3f9336a636cf" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504875} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8978162-3183-572e-ba61-5bac0d83a6cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504945} {:answer/id #uuid "b693532e-cc29-5a34-afa2-ee32a220fb84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 1